  "summary": "Install-time exfiltration of host identifiers to hardcoded IP via lifecycle scripts",
  "details": "package.json declares preinstall and postinstall lifecycle hooks that invoke curl against the hardcoded bare-IP endpoint http://54.37.234.136/voicemail, embedding the output of whoami, hostname, current working directory, and a timestamp in the query string. These scripts execute automatically on `npm install`, transmitting the installer's username, host, and working-directory context to an attacker-controlled destination. The package ships no other functionality consistent with a legitimate purpose.",
